{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"5315cabc8e984f52905806809a02516b","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"46ee3fb3a03aea468ca9610af15af6e78d2d","content_type":2,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=46ee3fb3a03aea468ca9610af15af6e78d2d","view_num":10216,"pub_timestamp":"1667383200","title":"정식 런칭 관련 FAQ","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=46ee3fb3a03aea468ca9610af15af6e78d2d","content":"\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e친애하는 지휘관님, 《승리의 여신: 니케》에 대한 관심에 감사드립니다!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e본\u0026nbsp;게임은\u0026nbsp;2022년\u0026nbsp;11월\u0026nbsp;4일에 글로벌 런칭이 됩니다.\u0026nbsp;또한\u0026nbsp;11월\u0026nbsp;3일부터\u0026nbsp;App Store와\u0026nbsp;Google play\u0026nbsp;앱스토어에서\u0026nbsp;사전\u0026nbsp;다운로드가\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e니케 운영진이 다운로드와 글로벌 오픈에 대한 QA를 준비했습니다. 도움이 되시길 바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ1. 게임 기기의 최소 사양은 어떻게 되나요?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA2.\u003c/strong\u003e 최소 사양:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- 저장공간 4GB\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- Android 7.0, 램 3GB\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- iOS 11.0 \u0026amp; iPhone 7+\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- 모바일 시스템 64bit\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eQ2. PC 및 가로 버전을 출시할 계획이 있나요?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA2. \u003c/strong\u003e11월 4일 글로벌 동시 공개일에는 iOS와 안드로이드 버전만 출시됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e하지만 PC 버전도 고려 중이며, 새로운 정보가 있으면 지휘관님께 안내해 드리겠습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e(각 지역의 정책에 따라 출시 날짜는 서로 차이가 있을 수 있습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eQ3. 사전등록 보상 상세 목록, 수령 방법, 지급 일자가 어떻게 되나요?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA3. \u003c/strong\u003e글로벌 사전등록 300만 명 달성 보상:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- 3,000 쥬얼\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- SR 니케 에테르 x 1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- SSR 니케 디젤 x 1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e※ 모든 보상은 서버 정식 오픈 후 우편함을 통해 지급됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e※ 사전등록 300만 명 달성 보상 SSR 니케 디젤은 정식 오픈 2개월 내 로그인 시 획득할 수 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ4. 텍스트 및 시나리오 더빙은 어떤 언어를 지원하나요?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA4. \u003c/strong\u003e공식 출시 버전 언어:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- 한국어, 영어, 일본어, 중국어 번체, 중국어 간체, 독일어, 태국어\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e시나리오 더빙:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- 한국어, 일본어, 영어\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e※ 게임에 처음 접속 시 기기 설정에 따라 언어가 설정되며, 서버 오픈 후 게임 설정에서 언어를 변경하실 수 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003eTip) 게임 언어와 더빙 언어를 자유롭게 선택할 수 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ5. 계정은 어떻게 생성하나요? 로그인 방식에는 어떤 것이 있나요?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA5. \u003c/strong\u003e계정 생성 방법:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- 게임에 처음 접속 시 이메일을 통해 계정을 생성\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- 안드로이드: Google, Facebook, Twitter, LINE, 게스트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- iOS: Apple, Facebook, Twitter, LINE, 게스트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e※ 게스트 방식으로 로그인할 때는 계정 데이터 보호를 위해 추후 이메일 혹은 다른 계정과 연동해주세요.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e※ 기기를 전환하거나 게임 삭제 시 게스트 계정의 결제 내역을 포함한 모든 데이터가 삭제될 수 있으며 복구가 어려울 수 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e※ 연동한 이메일로 로그인할 수 있으며, 계정을 찾거나 보호할 수 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ6. 사전 다운로드는 어떻게 하나요?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA6.\u003c/strong\u003e 사전 다운로드 기간\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- 2022년 11월 3일\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e■ 사전 다운로드 주소\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- AOS: \u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.proximabeta.nikke\"\u003ehttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.proximabeta.nikke\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- iOS: \u003ca href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id1585915174\"\u003ehttps://apps.apple.com/app/id1585915174\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e※ 다운로드를 진행하기 전에 반드시 이전 버전의 어플을 삭제해 주세요.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e※ 앱스토어의 경우 스토어측의 이슈로 인해 공개가 다소 지연될 수 있는 점 미리 양해 부탁드립니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ7. 몇 개의 서버가 있으며 어떤 서버를 선택하는 것이 좋은가요?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA7. \u003c/strong\u003e대한민국, 일본, 북미, 동남아, 글로벌(유럽) 서버 총 5개의 서버가 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e사용자의 위치에 따라 맞는 서버를 선택해 주시기 바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eQ8. 서버를 선택하여 계정을 생성한 후에 서버를 바꿀 수 있나요?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA8. \u003c/strong\u003e계정을 생성한 후에도 서버 변경이 가능합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e하지만 데이터는 변경한 서버로 옮겨지지 않습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ9. 안드로이드와 iOS의 데이터가 호환되나요?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA9. \u003c/strong\u003e게스트 계정을 제외하고는 안드로이드와 iOS 기기간의 데이터가 호환됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e※ 이메일, SNS 등 로그인 방식의 연동을 완료하신 후, 새로운 기기에서 연동된 계정으로 로그인해 주시기 바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ10. 게임 공식 커뮤니티가 있나요?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA10. \u003c/strong\u003e공식 커뮤니티:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- 네이버 라운지: \u003ca href=\"https://game.naver.com/lounge/nikke\"\u003ehttps://game.naver.com/lounge/nikke\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- 트위터: \u003ca href=\"https://twitter.com/NIKKE_kr\"\u003ehttps://twitter.com/NIKKE_kr\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- 유튜브: \u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/nikkekr\"\u003ehttps://www.youtube.com/nikkekr\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- 페이스북: \u003ca href=\"https://www.facebook.com/nikke.kr.official\"\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/nikke.kr.official\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eQ11. 게임에 대한 문의는 어디로 해야 하나요?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA11. \u003c/strong\u003e게임과 관련된 사항은 고객센터로 문의해주시기 바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e고객센터:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e- help@nikke-kr.com\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e설명: 이상 정보의 내용은 11월 4일 업로드되는 버전을 기준으로 합니다.\u003cbr\u003e이후\u0026nbsp;수정\u0026nbsp;내용은\u0026nbsp;공식\u0026nbsp;정보를\u0026nbsp;확인해주세요.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e","spider_score":"-999","pic_urls":["https://d13qzzxzwls0q1.cloudfront.net/cms/nrft/feeds/pic/_1fed5d2417c7ed8704f36052642cb9fa42bf66f5.jpeg"],"jump_link":{},"content_desc":"정식 런칭 관련 FAQ","primary_label_ids":[308,309],"secondary_lab